  "population": "Original impaired-glucose-tolerance trial cohort in Da Qing, China; retained clinical follow-up subset. Pooled clinic-randomized diet/exercise interventions and control; no current-state or U.S. mapping.",
  "time_period": "1986-2009; scheduled OGTT during original trial, then mainly clinical diagnosis ascertainment between later follow-up assessments.",
  "unit": "Literal deaths and published whole person-years by updated age and time before or since recorded diabetes diagnosis",
  "uncertainty": "Source observations retain displayed precision. No sampling distribution, confidence interval, covariance or independence assumption imposed; repeated person-time and clinic dependence unresolved.",
  "rights": "Source HTML excluded from repository and distribution. Only attributed literal public aggregate facts, authored audit and receipts are committed; no participant records.",
  "clinical_unknowns": [
    "Baseline IGT does not guarantee persistent IGT before diagnosis; current glycemic reversion is not observed here",
    "Dates after the original trial depend mainly on clinical diagnoses rather than systematic scheduled OGTTs",
    "Displayed person-years are rounded aggregates, not individual clocks or complete linked histories",
    "Intervention groups are pooled in this mortality analysis; it does not isolate diet-only assignment",
    "Time-dependent association is not a causal effect of changing diabetes state",
    "Incomplete follow-up and baseline-only confounder adjustment do not establish ignorable selection or transport to the U.S."
  ],
